"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/c81307d1eb041a7523dd9fd1c1afa7b4.poster.avif?t=1787926625\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/c81307d1eb041a7523dd9fd1c1afa7b4.webm?t=1787926625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Soul Shapes Its Level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage reflects the inner world of a trapped soul, formed by rage, grief, silence, or longing. The architecture, the light, the tension; all echo the soul’s personality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/3470f8a164f1f2cc18d2a1991a65661b.poster.avif?t=1787926625\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/3470f8a164f1f2cc18d2a1991a65661b.webm?t=1787926625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Labyrinth of Minds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just moving through space; you’re navigating memories, traumas, and forgotten thoughts. Every level is a mental maze where the challenge is both physical and emotional. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.poster.avif?t=1787926625\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.webm?t=1787926625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Free the Souls, Open the Way </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Gather light. Unlock the cage. Open spiritual portals that carry you from one haunted mind to the next. This isn’t just progress, it’s liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.poster.avif?t=1787926625\" width=200 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.webm?t=1787926625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.mp4?t=1787926625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder Parkour is now on Steam! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious? Add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and get ready to jump in when the time comes.</p>", "short_description": "Every step is a promise, every fall a risk you can't take. In your arms, a small puppy who can't cross this world alone, carry them through every obstacle, steady every leap, and never let go. They trust you with everything; hold on, rise, and bring them home.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, Spanish - Spain, French, German, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/ef89b754edba38f4e65c84